      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The slaves report the death of so-and-so, the son of so-and-so, the Jew, on such-and-such a day of such-and-such a month,</li>\n<li>in such-and-such a year. He left as heirs his son called so-and-so,</li>\n<li>his daughter called so-and-so, his wife called so-and-so; daughter of so-and-so, and&nbsp;his paternal cousin</li>\n<li>called so-and-so, son of so-and-so. When they had verified this they wrote their&nbsp;signatures on it,</li>\n<li>on the aforementioned date. Praise be to God, the one, the living, the eternal.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
